# The 10-minute auto-refresh is retired (Peter 2026-10-06, decision 2a): every refresh swaps
# the feed's inode, which the running sandbox's binding label reads as drift and stops the
# sandbox. The mirror now refreshes only when a release is switched — run the oneshot service
# and recreate the sandbox right after (recreate-on-release). F's immutable generations
# replace the swap later. This unit intentionally has no [Install]: it must not come back at boot.
[Unit]
Description=Refresh AUKORA Prime main mirror every 10 min (DISABLED: recreate-on-release only)

[Timer]
OnBootSec=2min
OnUnitActiveSec=10min
